{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6c496e77-229a-46ec-a293-1030bce8d7e3",
    "name": "Mobil Legend API",
    "description": "Koleksi API katalog mobil bekas Mobil Legend. Field status, color, transmission, mileage, fuel, registration_number, validity_period, showroom_name, showroom_address bersifat opsional dan nullable. Status: ready, pending, reserve, sold. Color maksimal 100 karakter. Mileage: integer kilometer 0-2147483647. Validity_period: tanggal YYYY-MM-DD. Bulk menerima null JSON; PATCH form-data menerima teks null atau string kosong untuk mengosongkan field. Field yang tidak dikirim pada PATCH tidak berubah. Semua response gambar berbentuk {id,url,highlight}; pilih gambar list dengan highlight=true melalui PATCH car-images/{id} tanpa body.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "carId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "carImageId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login berhasil', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 && body.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cars",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Cars",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('Daftar mobil berhasil', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Response daftar memiliki field tambahan', () => {",
              "  pm.response.json().data.forEach(car => {",
              "    ['status', 'transmission', 'mileage', 'validity_period'].forEach(field => pm.expect(car).to.have.property(field));",
              "    ['fuel', 'registration_number', 'showroom_name', 'showroom_address'].forEach(field => pm.expect(car).not.to.have.property(field));",
              "    car.images.forEach(image => pm.expect(image.highlight).to.be.a('boolean'));",
              "    pm.expect(car.images.filter(image => image.highlight).length).to.be.at.most(1);",
              "  });",
              "});"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "description": "Response pagination tetap memiliki data, page, perpage, total, totalPages. Setiap mobil memiliki status, color, transmission, mileage (km), validity_period (YYYY-MM-DD); semua dapat bernilai null. Seluruh gambar tetap dikembalikan dalam images berupa {id,url,highlight}. Frontend memilih images.find(image => image.highlight); jika belum ada pilihan, tampilkan placeholder. Field fuel, registration_number, showroom_name, showroom_address hanya tersedia pada detail dan response tulis.",
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cars?page=1&perpage=10&name=toyota&start_year=2018&end_year=2026",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cars"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "perpage", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "name", "value": "toyota", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "start_year", "value": "2018", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "end_year", "value": "2026", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Car Detail",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('Detail mobil berhasil', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) pm.collectionVariables.set('carImageId', pm.response.json().images?.[0]?.id || '');",
              "pm.test('Response detail memiliki field tambahan dan highlight', () => {",
              "  const car = pm.response.json();",
              "  ['status', 'color', 'transmission', 'mileage', 'fuel', 'registration_number', 'validity_period', 'showroom_name', 'showroom_address'].forEach(field => pm.expect(car).to.have.property(field));",
              "  car.images.forEach(image => pm.expect(image).to.have.all.keys('id', 'url', 'highlight'));",
              "  car.images.forEach(image => pm.expect(image.highlight).to.be.a('boolean'));",
              "  pm.expect(car.images.filter(image => image.highlight).length).to.be.at.most(1);",
              "});"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": { 
            "description": "Response detail menambahkan status, color, transmission, mileage, fuel, registration_number, validity_period, showroom_name, showroom_address. Semua nullable. Tanggal berformat YYYY-MM-DD, mileage dalam kilometer. Setiap gambar berbentuk {id,url,highlight}. Ambil ulang detail setelah PATCH highlight untuk melihat pilihan terbaru.",
            "method": "GET", 
            "header": [], 
            "url": { 
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cars/{{carId}}", 
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], 
              "path": ["cars", "{{carId}}"] 
            } 
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Cars",
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('Mobil dibuat', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "if (body[0]) pm.collectionVariables.set('carId', body[0].id);",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.collectionVariables.set('carImageId', body[0]?.images?.[0]?.id || '');"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "description": "Field cars adalah string array JSON berisi 1-20 mobil. Field tambahan termasuk color opsional dan menerima null; jika tidak diisi disimpan null, termasuk status (tanpa default). Status: ready|pending|reserve|sold. Mileage integer 0-2147483647 km. Validity_period YYYY-MM-DD. Batas panjang: color/transmission/fuel 100, registration_number 30, showroom_name 150 karakter. Response berisi array detail mobil. Gambar baru berbentuk {id,url,highlight:false}; pemilihan highlight dilakukan melalui endpoint khusus.",
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [
              { "key": "cars", "value": "[{\"name\":\"Avanza Veloz\",\"manufacturer\":\"Toyota\",\"year\":2022,\"price\":275000000,\"description\":\"Kondisi terawat\",\"status\":\"ready\",\"transmission\":\"Automatic\",\"mileage\":45000,\"fuel\":\"Bensin\",\"registration_number\":\"B 1234 ABC\",\"validity_period\":\"2027-10-07\",\"showroom_name\":\"Mobil Legend Jakarta\",\"showroom_address\":\"Jl. Sudirman No. 10, Jakarta\"}]", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "images_0", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }
            ] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cars/bulk", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cars", "bulk"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Car",
          "request": {
            "description": "Semua field opsional. Field tambahan termasuk color menerima teks null atau string kosong untuk menghapus nilainya; nonaktifkan/hilangkan field agar nilainya tidak berubah. Status ready|pending|reserve|sold; mileage integer 0-2147483647 km; validity_period YYYY-MM-DD. Response adalah detail mobil. Update tanpa perubahan gambar mempertahankan highlight; upload tambahan bernilai highlight=false. Menghapus gambar highlight tidak otomatis memilih pengganti.",
            "method": "PATCH", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "formdata", "formdata": [
              { "key": "name", "value": "Avanza Veloz Q", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "price", "value": "290000000", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "status", "value": "pending", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "color", "value": "Silver Metallic", "type": "text", "disabled": true },
              { "key": "transmission", "value": "Automatic", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "mileage", "value": "46000", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "fuel", "value": "Bensin", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "registration_number", "value": "B 1234 ABC", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "validity_period", "value": "2028-10-07", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "showroom_name", "value": "Mobil Legend Jakarta", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "showroom_address", "value": "Jl. Sudirman No. 10, Jakarta", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "removeImageIds", "value": "[]", "type": "text", "disabled": true, "description": "Aktifkan hanya untuk menghapus gambar dan isi array JSON UUID. Tidak dikirim, kosong, atau [] berarti tidak menghapus gambar lama." },
              { "key": "images", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }
            ] },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cars/{{carId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["cars", "{{carId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Highlight Car Image",
          "response": [{
            "name": "200 - Gambar highlight terpilih",
            "originalRequest": {
              "method": "PATCH",
              "header": [],
              "url": "{{baseUrl}}/car-images/{{carImageId}}"
            },
            "status": "OK",
            "code": 200,
            "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"edb94b14-c065-4b82-a8bf-a8294971bbbd\",\n  \"url\": \"/uploads/gambar-mobil.jpg\",\n  \"highlight\": true\n}"
          }],
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "exec": [
              "pm.test('Highlight berhasil', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('Response gambar terpilih', () => {",
              "  const image = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(image.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('carImageId'));",
              "  pm.expect(image.url).to.be.a('string');",
              "  pm.expect(image.highlight).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ] }
          }],
          "request": {
            "description": "Tanpa body. Gunakan carImageId (UUID gambar, bukan UUID mobil) dari response Add Cars atau Get Car Detail. Gambar terpilih menjadi highlight=true dan gambar lain untuk mobil yang sama menjadi false dalam satu transaksi. Gambar mobil lain tidak berubah. Memerlukan bearer token; 400 untuk UUID salah, 401 untuk token tidak valid, 404 untuk gambar tidak ditemukan. Response 200: {id, url, highlight:true}. GET detail menampilkan highlight pada setiap gambar.",
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/car-images/{{carImageId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["car-images", "{{carImageId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Car",
          "request": { 
            "method": "DELETE", 
            "header": [], 
            "url": { 
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/cars/{{carId}}", 
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], 
              "path": ["cars", "{{carId}}"] 
            } 
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}